<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman targets 485p on Rank.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman targets 485p on Rank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers analyst Fraser Ramzan said on Monday he was targeting the 485p level on shares in Rank Group Plc Plc.</p>
<p>At 1254 GMT, the shares were up one penny to 440p.</p>
<p>Ramzan, who two weeks ago initiated coverage of Rank with an &quot;outperform&quot; rating, reitereated his recommendation, citing the group's new management and share buyback potential.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
